         <widget class="QLabel" name="form_note">
          <property name="text">
           <string>Unlock the aspect ratio to set width and height independently. Dimensions include the title and wrapped legend. Plots reflow to fit; a locked X:Y unit ratio is preserved by expanding the visible range. 3D renders into the new viewport. DPI sets print size.

Axes and lines scale with the plot. Viewer controls and hover cursors are excluded. Image pixels and curves use full source detail; 2D points and 3D use the current grid sampling. Background and text colors follow the viewer theme. SVG keeps Qt plot text/curves as vectors and embeds 2D image pixels.</string>
